<title>BELGIUM: CCB/GEMEENTEKREDIET TO CUT DEPOSIT BOOK RATE.</title>
<headline>CCB/GEMEENTEKREDIET TO CUT DEPOSIT BOOK RATE.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian bank Credit Communal de Belgique/Gemeentekrediet said on Thursday it would cut the base rate on its deposit book accounts to 2.25 percent from 2.50 percent.</p>
<p>Its growth and loyalty premiums remained unchanged at 1.00 percent and 0.5 percent respectively.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
